<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-liangshu" book-id="b-liangshu-021" chapter-id="c-liangshu-021-wangfen" source-id="s-liangshu-021-wangfen-ws1544250">
  <p id="c-liangshu-021-wangfen:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-021-wangfen:p001:m0000" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AB">王份</persName>字<persName id="c-liangshu-021-wangfen:p001:m0003" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AB">季文</persName>，琅邪人也。祖<persName id="c-liangshu-021-wangfen:p001:m0012" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn">僧朗</persName>，宋開府儀同三司、元公。父<persName id="c-liangshu-021-wangfen:p001:m0027" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_A">粹</persName>，黃門侍郎。</p>
  <p id="c-liangshu-021-wangfen:p002" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-021-wangfen:p002:m0000" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AB">份</persName>兄<persName id="c-liangshu-021-wangfen:p002:m0002" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AA">奐</persName>於雍州被誅，<persName id="c-liangshu-021-wangfen:p002:m0009" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AA">奐</persName>子<persName id="c-liangshu-021-wangfen:p002:m0011" ref="l1w_swd_dj8">肅</persName>奔于魏，<persName id="c-liangshu-021-wangfen:p002:m0016" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AB">份</persName>自拘請罪，齊世祖知其誠款，喻而遣之。</p>
  <p id="c-liangshu-021-wangfen:p003" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">時修建二郊，<persName id="c-liangshu-021-wangfen:p003:m0006" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AB">份</persName>以本官領大匠卿，遷散騎常侍、右光祿大夫，加親信爲四十人。遷侍中、特進、左光祿，復以本官監丹陽尹。普通五年三月，卒，時年七十九。詔贈本官，賻錢四十萬，布四百匹，蠟四百斤，給東園秘器，朝服一具，衣一襲。諡胡子。</p>
  <p id="c-liangshu-021-wangfen:p004" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">長子<persName id="c-liangshu-021-wangfen:p004:m0002" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABA">琳</persName>，字<persName id="c-liangshu-021-wangfen:p004:m0005" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABA">孝璋</persName>，舉南徐州秀才，釋褐征虜建安王法曹、司徒東閤祭酒，南平王文學。尚義興公主，拜駙馬都尉。</p>
  <p id="c-liangshu-021-wangfen:p005" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-021-wangfen:p005:m0000" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAB">錫</persName>字<persName id="c-liangshu-021-wangfen:p005:m0002" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAB">公嘏</persName>，<persName id="c-liangshu-021-wangfen:p005:m0005" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABA">琳</persName>之第二子也。</p>
  <p id="c-liangshu-021-wangfen:p006" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">中大通六年正月，卒，時年三十六。贈侍中，給東園秘器，朝服一具，衣一襲。諡貞子。</p>
</text>
